# Audit AI and Graph\-RAG Pipelines

`audit-ai-or-graph-rag` · learning path

| Field | Value |
| --- | --- |
| Audience | Developers recording extracted facts, chunks, and tools\. |

## Goal

Connect generated claims to source chunks, evidence spans, tools, model context, and provenance before consumers see them\.

## Quickstart

```turtle
# gmeow:Chunk
<subject> a gmeow:Chunk ;
    gmeow:chunkChapterHeading "..." ;  # rdfs:Literal
    gmeow:chunkInDivision <...> ;  # gmeow:ContentSegment
    gmeow:chunkMarkerLines <...> ;  # gmeow:StructuredSequence
    gmeow:chunkOf <...> ;  # gmeow:InformationObject
    gmeow:chunkSectionHeading "..." ;  # rdfs:Literal
    gmeow:chunkSectionTag "..." ;  # xsd:string
    gmeow:chunkSubsectionHeading "..." .  # rdfs:Literal

# gmeow:Dataset
<subject> a gmeow:Dataset ;
    gmeow:citeAs "..." ;  # rdfs:Literal
    gmeow:version "..." .

# gmeow:EvidenceSpan
<subject> a gmeow:EvidenceSpan ;
    gmeow:locusHref "..." ;
    gmeow:locusSource <...> ;  # gmeow:InformationObject
    gmeow:occurrenceInAnalysisInput <...> ;  # lang:Analysis
    gmeow:occurrenceSurface <...> ;  # lang:SurfaceForm
    gmeow:recognizerLabel "..." ;  # xsd:string
    gmeow:rootTokenParse <...> ;  # lang:TokenParseReport
    gmeow:selectorLocator "..." ;  # rdfs:Literal
    gmeow:selectorPage "..." .  # rdfs:Literal
# … +3 more properties carried by this class (see the class page for the full list)

# gmeow:ExtractedEntity
<subject> a gmeow:ExtractedEntity .

# gmeow:usedModel
<subject> a gmeow:ModelInvocation ;
    gmeow:usedModel <...> .  # gmeow:SoftwareAgent
```

